"description":"POWER EVERY WINNING DECISION\nThe PFF app puts pro-level tools at your fingertips. Win drafts with award-winning fantasy rankings. Nail prop bets with data-backed picks. Build your team’s future with the #1 Mock Draft Simulator and in-depth prospect scouting. Get coverage and expert analysis that keeps you ahead of the game. Think like an analyst, operate like a GM, and win like a pro. All in the PFF app.\n\nWIN DRAFTS, WEEKS AND LEAGUES\nFantasy league winners use PFF. Tap into award-winning rankings to find real sleepers and hidden value throughout the season. Build weekly lineups with the same data used by all 32 NFL teams. Tools include:\n\n-My Team Dashboard: weekly player and matchup projections, roster news and injury status\n-Rankings: your blueprint to building a championship roster\n-Start/Sit Optimizer: nail your lineup using the same data as all 32 NFL teams\n\nConquer fantasy from draft day to league championship. Win with PFF.\n\nNAIL YOUR BETS\nBuilt by football experts, designed for bettors. The Player Prop Tool uses PFF player grades, matchup data and predictive analytics to deliver clear, high-confidence prop picks every week. Betting tools include:\n\n-Real-time lines, projections, matchup analysis and cover probabilities\n-Historical hit rates and player prop covers against similar defenses\n-Matchup advantages and analysis\n-Fast filters by player, game, position and stat\n-Integration with the top sportsbooks for seamless betting\n\nThe Player Prop Tool is your one-stop hub for betting insights. Win on game day like a pro.\n\nOPERATE LIKE A GM\nBuild your team’s future with pro-level tools. From draft strategy to deep prospect scouting, PFF gives you the data edge and grades trusted by all 32 NFL teams. Explore:\n\n-Mock Draft Simulator: Draft for any or all teams, explore endless scenarios, and as a PFF+ subscriber, unlock all seven rounds with full trade capabilities.\n-Big Board: Scout hundreds of NFL prospects with detailed reports, including scheme fits, player strengths and weaknesses, player comps, grades, and advanced metrics—all in one place.\nSee how draft day decisions translate to winning seasons.\n\nKNOW MORE, WIN MORE\nGet exclusive access to expert analysis, diving deep into the data to build strategies, spot trends and amplify winning opportunities. Content includes:\n\n-Fantasy analysis, breakouts and rankings\n-Betting 101, value picks and insights\n-NFL, NCAA and CFL coverage\n\nPFF turns data into action at game speed. Level up with the smartest analysis in football.\n\nDOWNLOAD THE PFF APP. START YOUR WIN STREAK TODAY.\n\nNOTE: PFF does not offer real money gaming. While the PFF app includes sports betting content & data,  no gaming/betting takes place within the PFF app.\nPFF does NOT receive any revenue share from any sportsbooks. Our only goal is to provide all fans with the best information possible to increase their ability to enjoy the game. We do not accept or place bets of any kind. The information is for entertainment purposes only & we strongly encourage that you use it responsibly; you should never wager more than you can comfortably afford to spend. What you choose to do with the information & analysis provided is your decision, remember that past performance does not guarantee future outcomes even when using machine learning and statistical modeling. If you or someone you know has a gambling problem please call 1-800-GAMBLER.\n\nTerms of Use: https://www.pff.com/terms", "userRatingCount":365}]
